      {
        "id": 109604,
        "name": "Under3",
        "username": "Under3",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/under3/{size}/1872_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-07-18T17:30:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I would probably have played it as the effect has started so carries on as there’s nothing specifically interrupting it as such, sub zero atmosphere has had its effect when the attack started, and then the attack goes off at the end of turn again.<br>\nAny further cards waiting to go off wouldn’t and would revert to just end of turn. They’ve been interrupted before they started by the removal of Absolute Zero’s cards.</p>\n<p>But I may be a little vicious.</p>",
