      {
        "id": 109606,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-07-18T18:09:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Under3\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/under3/48/1872_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Under3:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I would probably have played it as the effect has started so carries on as there's nothing specifically interrupting it as such, sub zero atmosphere has had its effect when the attack started, and then the attack goes off at the end of turn again.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>The newly considered \"start of turn\" effect damage would interupt as soon as the effect stops being \"start of turn\", hence damage interupts when AbZero leaves play.</p>",
        "post_number": 7,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:40:24.238Z",
